# Explicit allowlist-by-exclusion for `vercel --prod` uploads.
# A prior cycle's deploy failed with "Request Entity Too Large" because a
# 2.8GB OOM crash dump (`core`, gitignored but NOT vercelignored) sat in the
# project directory and got swept into the upload anyway. .vercelignore is
# always honored by the Vercel CLI, so list crash artifacts here explicitly
# rather than relying on .gitignore inference.
core
core.*
node_modules
.next
.git
coverage
shots-out
.data
*.tsbuildinfo
